
### Application Service API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5005
@candidateId = 1
@employerId = 1
@jobId = 1
@resumeId = 1
@applicationId = 1

### 1. Create application
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": {{jobId}},
  "resumeId": {{resumeId}},
  "coverLetter": "I am interested in the Java Backend Developer position. I have experience with Java 21, Spring Boot and PostgreSQL.",
  "expectedSalary": 3500,
  "availableFrom": "2026-12-01"
}

### 2. Get application by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}

### 3. Get my applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/my
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}

### 4. Get applications for a job
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/job/{{jobId}}

### 5. Filter applications for a job
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/job/{{jobId}}?status=PENDING&sortBy=AI_SCORE_DESC

### 6. Get company applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/company
X-User-Id: {{employerId}}

### 7. Filter company applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/company?job={{jobId}}&status=PENDING&isStarred=true
X-User-Id: {{employerId}}

### 8. Update application status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
X-User-Id: {{employerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PENDING"
}

### 9. Toggle starred status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}/star
X-User-Id: {{employerId}}

### 10. Withdraw application
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}/withdraw
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "I have accepted another job offer"
}

### 11. Delete application
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
